cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Test-it-off Simulation – Automated PCBA Testing Cell in MuJoCo"
abstract: >-
  A MuJoCo simulation of KINALI's Test-it-off PCBA test cell (an AUBO i5 robot with a vacuum gripper and a fork, a
  two-axis loader, the MG06 test fixture) in which a robot program for the whole process is written, checked
  kinematically, run with full physics and compared: a taught Default program and an Optimized program with planned
  free moves and the loader in parallel under interlocks. Every output is a simulation result; nothing is validated for
  driving the real cell.
